	Method	Endpoint				Purpose
	
	POST	/parking/entries			Park a vehicle and create a ticket
	GET	/parking/tickets/{id}			Retrieve ticket details
	POST	/parking/exits/quote			Calculate the fee due
	POST	/parking/exits/{ticketId}/payment	Pay for a parking session
	POST	/parking/exits/{ticketId}/complete	Complete exit and release the spot
	GET	/parking/availability			Get available spots by floor and type
	
	The ticket ID should be generated uniquely. In a real implementation, timestamps should be stored consistently, usually in UTC, and displayed in the garage's local time zone.
	
